{"from_person_id": "zhubiao", "note": "朱允炆为懿文太子次子，朱标早逝后受太祖册立为皇太孙，建文元年即位。", "reign": "建文", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhuyunwen"}
{"from_person_id": "zhuchangluo", "note": "朱由检为光宗第五子，天启七年即位，是为思宗。", "reign": "崇祯", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhuyoujian"}
{"from_person_id": "zhuchangluo", "note": "朱由校为光宗长子，泰昌元年即位，是为熹宗。", "reign": "天启", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhuyouxiao"}
{"from_person_id": "zhudi", "note": "朱高炽为成祖长子，永乐二十二年即位，是为仁宗，在位仅十个月。", "reign": "洪熙", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhugaochi"}
{"from_person_id": "zhudi", "note": "朱高煦为成祖次子，靖难中为燕军主将，封汉王，宣德元年谋反被讨灭。", "reign": "洪武", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhugaoxu"}
{"from_person_id": "zhugaochi", "note": "朱瞻基为仁宗长子，洪熙元年即位，是为宣宗。", "reign": "宣德", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhuzhanji"}
{"from_person_id": "zhuqizhen", "note": "朱见深为英宗长子，天顺八年即位，是为宪宗。", "reign": "成化", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhujian"}
{"from_person_id": "zhuyijun", "note": "朱常洛为神宗长子，万历四十八年即位，是为光宗，在位月余而崩。", "reign": "泰昌", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhuchangluo"}
{"from_person_id": "zhuyuanzhang", "note": "朱标为太祖长子，洪武元年立为皇太子，监国十余年，洪武二十五年病逝，谥懿文。", "reign": "洪武", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhubiao"}
{"from_person_id": "zhuyuanzhang", "note": "朱棣为太祖第四子，初封燕王，建文四年靖难入继大统，是为成祖。", "reign": "永乐", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhudi"}
{"from_person_id": "zhuyuanzhang", "note": "朱权为太祖第十七子，封宁王，靖难时为朱棣所挟，后改封南昌。", "reign": "洪武", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhuquan"}
{"from_person_id": "zhuyuanzhang", "note": "朱橚为太祖第五子，初封吴王，后改封周王，博学工词，藩邸开封。", "reign": "洪武", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhusu"}
{"from_person_id": "zhuzhanji", "note": "朱祁钰为宣宗次子，土木之变后奉太后命监国即位，是为景帝。", "reign": "景泰", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhuqiyu"}
{"from_person_id": "zhuzhanji", "note": "朱祁镇为宣宗长子，宣德十年即位，是为英宗，先后两度在位。", "reign": "正统、天顺", "relation_type": "父子", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhuqizhen"}
{"from_person_id": "chenlin", "note": "吴惟忠为陈璘部将，随征朝鲜，露梁海战中隶陈璘水军。", "reign": "万历", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "wuweizhong"}
{"from_person_id": "hongchengchou", "note": "曹变蛟为松锦八总兵之一，松山突围时力战死。", "reign": "崇祯", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "caobianjiao"}
{"from_person_id": "hongchengchou", "note": "吴三桂为松锦八总兵之一，隶洪承畴麾下，后为山海关总兵。", "reign": "崇祯", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "wusangui"}
{"from_person_id": "hongchengchou", "note": "洪承畴总督蓟辽，松锦之战中祖大寿守锦州，城破后降清。", "reign": "崇祯", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zudashou"}
{"from_person_id": "lijinglong", "note": "李景隆代耿炳文为北伐主帅，耿炳文以老将坐镇，兵败后罢。", "reign": "建文", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "gengbingwen"}
{"from_person_id": "sunchengzong", "note": "满桂受孙承宗调度，任山海关总兵，守辽有功。", "reign": "崇祯", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "mangui"}
{"from_person_id": "sunchengzong", "note": "马世龙为孙承宗部将，孙承宗再督辽时复起用之。", "reign": "崇祯", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "mashilong"}
{"from_person_id": "sunchengzong", "note": "孙承宗督师收复遵永四城，祖大寿时为部将，大凌河之役后降清。", "reign": "崇祯", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zudashou"}
{"from_person_id": "wangji-2", "note": "王骥总督军务，蒋贵为总兵官。", "reign": "正统", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "jianggui"}
{"from_person_id": "wangji-2", "note": "王骥奉司礼监王振意旨力主征麓川，以媚王振。", "reign": "正统", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "wangzhen"}
{"from_person_id": "wangshouren", "note": "王守仁巡抚南赣、提督军务，伍文定为部将，从平宸濠之乱。", "reign": "正德", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "wuwending"}
{"from_person_id": "weizhongxian", "note": "魏广微依附魏忠贤，入阁拜相，为阉党要员。", "reign": "天启", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "weiguangwei"}
{"from_person_id": "yanggao", "note": "杨镐经略辽东，李如柏为南路军主将。", "reign": "万历", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "lirubai"}
{"from_person_id": "yanggao", "note": "李如松曾受杨镐节制于辽东。", "reign": "万历", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "lirusong"}
{"from_person_id": "yanggao", "note": "王宣为西路杜松所部总兵。", "reign": "万历", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "wangxuan"}
{"from_person_id": "yangyiqing", "note": "杨一清总制平乱，仇钺为内应部将。", "reign": "正德", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "chouyue"}
{"from_person_id": "yuanchonghuan", "note": "孙承宗经略辽东，袁崇焕为其所识拔，后继任督师。", "reign": "天启", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "sunchengzong"}
{"from_person_id": "yuanchonghuan", "note": "赵率教为袁崇焕部将，己巳之变中战死遵化。", "reign": "崇祯", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zhaolvjiao"}
{"from_person_id": "yuanchonghuan", "note": "祖大寿为袁崇焕麾下大将，袁崇焕下狱后祖大寿一度东走。", "reign": "崇祯", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "zudashou"}
{"from_person_id": "yuqian", "note": "于谦主持京师防务，石亨为京师总兵官，德胜门之战却敌。", "reign": "景泰", "relation_type": "统属", "source_id": "mingshi-editorial-v1", "to_person_id": "shiheng"}
